  {
   "t": "group",
   "id": "5dbc2a7",
   "children": [
    {
     "t": "text",
     "html": "<p><img data-ref=\"https://www.thehighway90.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Hwy-90-Toy-Drive-800-x-360-px-1.png\" alt=\"Highway 90 holiday toy drive\"></p><h2>🎁Highway 90 X Timeless 2024 Holiday Toy Drive🎁</h2><p>The holiday season is here, and it’s the perfect time to spread some joy! Highway 90 is excited to host a Toy Drive, sponsored by <a href=\"/brands/timeless/\">Timeless</a>, to bring smiles to kids in need this season. Here’s how you can get involved:</p><h5><strong>✨How to Participate:</strong></h5><p>Simply donate a toy at Highway 90, and in return, you’ll receive <strong>25% OFF</strong> your Timeless purchase! But that’s not all – you’ll also get an additional <strong>5% stackable coupon</strong>! It’s the perfect way to get into the holiday spirit while saving on your favorite items.</p><h5><strong>✨Important Details:</strong></h5><ul><li>Donate now through <strong>12/16</strong> at Highway 90.</li><li>One toy donation per customer per day = 25% off + the bonus 5% coupon!</li><li>All toys collected will help brighten the season for children in need and will be collected on 12/16!</li></ul><p>As we approach our 1-year anniversary, Highway 90 is reflecting on the incredible support we’ve received from our community and giving back in the best way we know how. We are committed to making a positive impact and spreading holiday cheer to families who need it most. This Toy Drive is just one of the many ways we’re showing our appreciation for the amazing community that has helped us grow and thrive over the past year.</p><p>This is a limited-time offer, so don’t wait – stop by Highway 90, drop off a toy, and take advantage of these amazing deals today!</p><p>Let’s make this holiday season one to remember by giving back and saving big with <a href=\"/brands/timeless/\">Timeless</a>. 💖🎁</p><p>Learn more about Timeless at their website, <a href=\"https://www.timelessvapes.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Timelessvapes.com</a>, or shop their products on our website <a href=\"/brands/timeless/\">here</a>!</p><p>“Timeless is focused on community and industry engagement – creating unique experiences to engage our partners, budtenders, and consumers. Community, Culture, and Legacy are the building blocks of what we do at Timeless. We always have and will continue to work with local businesses, artists, charities, dispensary partners, and support the movements that we believe impact our industry and world for the better!</p>",
     "from": "content"
    }
   ]
  },
